      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Point%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Kenova Railroad Bridge connects South Point to Kenova, West Virginia, highlighting the village’s historic river trade role.",
